dventurous journey will bring various changes. You will encounter different enemies and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/f054b1d9f0cc250c580fb22f90f6f6e6.poster.avif?t=1761730058\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/f054b1d9f0cc250c580fb22f90f6f6e6.webm?t=1761730058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/f054b1d9f0cc250c580fb22f90f6f6e6.mp4?t=1761730058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether to proceed step by step or to make great strides forward is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/a7d60141180f80e0363036e7f5607e10.poster.avif?t=1761730058\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/a7d60141180f80e0363036e7f5607e10.webm?t=1761730058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/a7d60141180f80e0363036e7f5607e10.mp4?t=1761730058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The official version of 《ArcaneDeck ChessWraith》includes the following content Currently:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2+ battle scene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ available cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ available champions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ different enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
